. * ===========================================================================
> ===
. * 4.3  ROBUSTNESS FOR THE PHASE 2 OUTCOMES
. * ===========================================================================
> ===
. * Each block re-estimates the six Phase 2 outcomes under one change. Every
. * block writes one row group to net_tab_robustness.tex.
. 
. * ---- Sample flag: top half of P0 award-record availability ----------------
> ------
. * WHY? Network histories are built only from lots WITH award records. Authori
> ties
. * that rarely report awards look like they have no suppliers, which mechanica
> lly
. * inflates "new"/"outsider". Restricting to authorities that report well in P
> 0
. * (share of their P0 lots with has_award == 1 above the median authority) che
> cks
. * that the results are not driven by reporting gaps.
. preserve
. use authority_id period pub_date has_award using "data/intermediate/lots_v2.d
> ta", clear
. net_recode_pre
. keep if period == 0
(987,537 observations deleted)
. collapse (mean) p0_avail = has_award, by(authority_id)
. quietly summarize p0_avail, detail
. local med = r(p50)
. gen byte top_avail = (p0_avail > `med')
. di as text "  $NET_PRELAB award-record availability: median authority share =
>  " %6.4f `med'
  P0 award-record availability: median authority share = 0.2500
. count if top_avail == 1
  6,769
. di as text "  authorities strictly above the median: " r(N) " of " _N
  authorities strictly above the median: 6769 of 13959
. tempfile avail
. save `avail'
file /var/folders/gl/dfj5g8l55533rf33t_3n36tc0000gn/T//St90593.000004 saved
    as .dta format
. restore
. merge m:1 authority_id using `avail', keep(master match) nogen keepusing(top_
> avail p0_avail)

    Result                      Number of obs
    -----------------------------------------
    Not matched                        23,833
        from master                    23,833  
        from using                          0  

    Matched                           598,568  
    -----------------------------------------
. replace top_avail = 0 if missing(top_avail)
(23,833 real changes made)
. 
. * ---- Value-band treatment variable (existing code, section 4.7) -----------
> -----
. gen byte treat_band = .
(622,401 missing values generated)
. replace treat_band = 1 if importo_lotto >= 100000 & importo_lotto < 130000
(47,972 real changes made)
. replace treat_band = 0 if importo_lotto >= 150000 & importo_lotto < 180000
(21,944 real changes made)
. 
. * ---- Robustness table header ----------------------------------------------
> -----
. local rf "results/tables/net_tab_robustness$NET_SFX.tex"
. file open rt using "`rf'", write replace text
. file write rt "\begin{tabular}{l*{6}{c}}" _n "\toprule" _n
. file write rt " & Incumbent & Prior, not inc. & Indirect & Outsider & New & R
> eturn gap \\" _n
. file write rt "\midrule" _n
. file close rt
. 
. * ---- Helper: estimate the six outcomes for one specification and append ---
> ---
. * cmd      : the estimation command with @ in place of the outcome
. * coef     : name of the coefficient to report
. * label    : row label in the table
. * p0cond   : condition for the comparison mean (default: P0 below cutoff)
. 
. local S "main_sample == 1 & abs(x) <= 40000"
. local A "absorb(cpv2_post region_post ym) vce(cluster authority_id)"
. local RD "i.below##i.post##c.x"
. 
. di as text _n "--- 4.3 Robustness ---"

